\ Exact reference vectors for the new arbitrary-width day counters.
\ None of the test coordinates is converted to a native CAL number.
\ The wide sauce/gate implementations still need separate migration.

The test day magnitude is a wide quantity.

To check wide counters around Foundation:
  Put "15055671" into the test day magnitude.
  Set the wide calendar example's calculation day from the test day magnitude given -1.
  Set the wide calendar example's requested day from the test day magnitude given -1.
  Answer the wide calendar example.
  If the wide calendar example's calculation count is not "1",
    put "Wide Foundation calculation count was not one." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's requested count is not "1",
    put "Wide Foundation requested count was not one." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's day distance is not "1",
    put "Wide Foundation self-distance was not one." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's day sum is not "2",
    put "Wide Foundation count sum was not two." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's day direction is not 2,
    put "Wide Foundation direction was not equal." into the check report; exit.
  Put "15055672" into the test day magnitude.
  Set the wide calendar example's calculation day from the test day magnitude given -1.
  Put "15055670" into the test day magnitude.
  Set the wide calendar example's requested day from the test day magnitude given -1.
  Answer the wide calendar example.
  If the wide calendar example's calculation count is not "2",
    put "Wide previous-day numbering was wrong." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's requested count is not "3",
    put "Wide next-day numbering was wrong." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's day distance is not "3",
    put "Wide neighboring-day distance was wrong." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's day sum is not "5",
    put "Wide neighboring-day count sum was wrong." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's day direction is not 3,
    put "Wide neighboring-day direction was wrong." into the check report; exit.

To check immense wide day counters:
  Put "1000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000" into the test day magnitude.
  Set the wide calendar example's calculation day from the test day magnitude given -1.
  Set the wide calendar example's requested day from the test day magnitude given 1.
  Answer the wide calendar example.
  If the wide calendar example's calculation count is not "1999999999999999999999999999999999999999969888658",
    put "Enormous earlier calculation-day count lost precision." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's requested count is not "2000000000000000000000000000000000000000030111343",
    put "Enormous later requested-day count lost precision." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's day sum is not "4000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000001",
    put "Enormous day counter sum lost precision." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's day distance is not "2000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000001",
    put "Enormous inclusive day distance lost precision." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's day direction is not 3,
    put "Enormous forward day direction was wrong." into the check report; exit.
  Put "1000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000" into the test day magnitude.
  Set the wide calendar example's calculation day from the test day magnitude given 1.
  Set the wide calendar example's requested day from the test day magnitude given -1.
  Answer the wide calendar example.
  If the wide calendar example's calculation count is not "2000000000000000000000000000000000000000030111343",
    put "Reversing enormous days changed the wrong calculation count." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's requested count is not "1999999999999999999999999999999999999999969888658",
    put "Reversing enormous days changed the wrong requested count." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's day sum is not "4000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000001",
    put "Reversing enormous days changed the sum." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's day distance is not "2000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000001",
    put "Reversing enormous days changed the inclusive distance." into the check report; exit.
  If the wide calendar example's day direction is not 1,
    put "Reversing enormous days failed to reverse the direction." into the check report; exit.
